# Keep hosted image builds independent from local caches, runtime evidence and
# credentials. Dockerfiles copy only the workspace manifests plus apps,
# packages, tools and infra.
**

!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/
!apps/**
!packages/
!packages/**
!tools/
!tools/**
!infra/
!infra/**

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-*
**/.tmp
**/tmp
**/test-results
**/output
**/*.log
**/*.pid
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/*.env.example
